(defn- pj-pc-pat [] :string "~!!3,n!!*'$!\"o83!!!!!!\"&Q=!!!!!!!E9%!!*'\"!\"Ju$!!!!\"!!N?(!!!!!!!E9%!!3-#!!<3%!!!!!!!`K*!!!!!!\"/c,r!WQ*!!<3$!!!!!!\"/W*!!!!!!\"&Q3!!!!!!!E9%!!3-#!!<3%!<3$!!!`K+!!!!!!\"/c,qum'#!!<3$!<3$!!\"/W+!!!!!!\"&Q,!!!!!!!E9%!!3-#!\"&Q*!!!!!!\"&Q)!!!!!!##>4!!!!!!!<2o!!!!!")
